WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.459 --> 00:00:06.810
Within the TCP model, layers have devices,
protocols, and applications used at each layer.

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:11.420
For example, on the Application Layer, we
have all the software pieces of data, such

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:17.050
as the application protocols, HTTP, DNS, and
others, and data formats such as text and

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:18.400
image formats.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:23.650
Encryption takes place on this layer and the
use of session protocols such as RPC and PPTP.

00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:26.109
On the transport layer, TCP is the main protocol.

00:00:26.109 --> 00:00:32.759
IP is the main protocol on the Internet layer,
and we start to see hardware come into the

00:00:32.759 --> 00:00:36.800
model, as routers are used on this layer.

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:41.390
On the Network Access layer, switches and
the media used to transmit data, such as Ethernet

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:42.610
cables, are featured.

